The '''Monkey''' is a {{skill|foraging}} Pet that can be bought from [[Oringo the Traveling Zookeeper]] during the [[Traveling Zoo]] Event. It grants {{stat|Speed}} and {{stat|int}}, as well as abilities specifically for increasing your {{skill|foraging}} efficiency.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Monkey Pet''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Oringo;Oringo the Traveling Zookeeper}} during the [[Traveling Zoo]] event. Its price is dependent on its [[Rarity]].
