== Tips ==
*For {{gamemode|ironman}} players who don't mind waiting or using {{Item|Kat Flower}}s, it is recommended to buy a {{Common}}–{{Rare}} Monkey Pet, as upgrading it via {{NPCSprite|Kat}} allows you to skip grinding large amounts of wood.

== Trivia ==
